terest in full-time or part-time emergency hire roles (90 day appointments). Current Opportunities Position Location Open Date Close Date Assistant or Associate Professor of Psychology & Child Development - Cognitive Neuroscience (27/28) Cal Poly - San Luis Obispo Campus August 28, 2026 Open Until Filled The Psychology and Child Development Department in the College of Liberal Arts at California Polytechnic State University, San Luis Obispo, is seeking applications for two full-time, academic-year, tenure-track Assistant or Associate Professors in Cognitive Neuroscience to begin approximately August 12, 2027. Powered by PageUp © 2026\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCalifornia Polytechnic State University — San Luis Obispo, California 93407 — Phone: 805-756-1111 Web Accessibility Statement Cal Poly's commitment to diversity and inclusion informs our efforts in recruitment, hiring, and retention. Cal Poly is an equal opportunity employer. Notice of Non-Discrimination on the Basis of Gender or Sex and Contact Information for Title IX Coordinator"
